{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And remove</b>. I have explained it above." "<b>And the word שחרות</b>. From כי עלה השחר, for the days of שחרות are likened to dawn when it breaks, in the manner of אז יבקע כשחר אורך. Or שחרות may be an allusion to black [שחור] hair, from שחורה אני ונאוה."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {1 "The comment on Ecclesiastes 11:10, למעלה ('above') likely refers to Ibn Ezra's comment on 10:9 or another earlier verse; exact antecedent uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:12.257403704Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}